  "originalQuery": "As you configure a brand new Cloud SQL for MySQL database instance in Google Cloud, your application team has requested the deployment of one primary instance and two read replica instances. It is essential to adhere to Google's recommended practices to achieve high availability and optimize read performance. What should you do?",
  "originalOptions": "A. Configure the primary instance in one region, the first read replica in a second region, and the second read replica in a third region.<br/>B. Configure the primary instance in zone A and both read replicas in zone B, all in the same region.<br/>C. Configure the primary and both read replicas instances in zone A, all in the same region.<br/>D. Configure the primary instance in zone A, one read replica in zone B, and the second read replica in zone C, all in the same region.",
