  "qid": "245",
  "tip": "<p>When deciding replica placement, think in terms of <i>zones</i> for high availability within a <i>region</i> and keep read replicas close to the application to reduce <i>latency</i>. Use <i>cross region</i> replicas mainly for <i>DR</i> rather than everyday read scaling.</p>",
